                <h2 class="h2 fw-bold text-dark mt-1 mb-4">
                    Collections Summary
                </h2>

                <ul class="text-muted">
                    <li>Collections are used to store and manage multiple elements.</li>
                    <li>List&lt;T&gt; provides a dynamically sized ordered collection.</li>
                    <li>Dictionary&lt;TKey,TValue&gt; stores key-value pairs.</li>
                    <li>HashSet&lt;T&gt; stores unique values.</li>
                    <li>Queue&lt;T&gt; follows FIFO.</li>
                    <li>Stack&lt;T&gt; follows LIFO.</li>
                    <li>Collections provide useful methods for adding, removing, searching and sorting data.</li>
                    <li>Generic collections provide strong type safety.</li>
                    <li>Collections are widely used in real-world .NET applications.</li>
                </ul>

